+/* Set the limits at which the GPU stream's command buffer is committed: more
+ * than `max_ops` ops, or more than `max_mb` MB of their inputs (by default 40
+ * to 50 of each, by GPU class, or MLX_MAX_OPS_PER_BUFFER and
+ * MLX_MAX_MB_PER_BUFFER). A value <= 0 keeps that limit. The kernels and their
+ * order are the same at any limit; only the buffers they are committed in
+ * change. Returns the previous limits. Without Metal this is a no-op.
+ * */
+MLX_API std::pair<int, int> set_command_buffer_limits(int max_ops, int max_mb);
+
